# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Supabase PostgreSQL Connection String (DATABASE_URL)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Found in Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Database -> Connection string (URI)
# Format: postgresql://postgres.[project-ref]:[db-password]@aws-0-[region].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?sslmode=require
# Or Direct: postgresql://postgres:[db-password]@db.[project-ref].supabase.co:5432/postgres?sslmode=require
